  "hook_reason": "My experience leading cross-functional squads to deliver AI-driven solutions and architecting process automation that cut evidence effort by 92% aligns directly with Harvey’s need for a Legal Engineering Manager who can scale enablement and drive customer outcomes.",
  "body": "Harvey’s emphasis on leading and developing high-performing teams resonates with my track record: at ANZ I directed a $5M+ program portfolio across 5+ cross-functional squads of up to 40 resources, and currently as Scrum Master at the ATO I own sprint cadence, capacity management, and executive reporting for the Agile Kookaburras squad. The role’s requirement for deep familiarity with AI tools is met by my hands-on work architecting an LLM evaluation stack (Langfuse, Phoenix) that reduced error budget breaches by 38%, and delivering real-time AI/ML telemetry servers handling 10k+ concurrent devices. My commercial instincts and customer focus are evidenced by developing customer journey scorecards that improved delivery efficiency by 20% at Telstra, and by driving product ownership and commercial outcomes during ANZ’s cloud modernisation. I also bring a collaborative approach: I convened a cross-discipline technical war room that produced a binding automation recommendation in under three hours, unblocking critical testing.\n\nI would welcome the chance to discuss how my experience in scaling enablement, building customer-facing solutions, and leading technical teams can contribute to Harvey’s Legal Engineering organization. I am available for a conversation at your convenience and can provide further detail on the outcomes referenced here."
}
